    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bocchar</span></b> , ăris (in MSS.
		also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Boc-chor</span></b> , ŏris),
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				king of Mauritania at the time of the second Punic war</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				29, 30, 1</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 29, 32, 1</span></i>.—Hence,
				<b>poet.</b> for <i>an
			African</i>, in gen., <i><span class="en">Juv. 5, 90</span></i>.</div>
